### Send one reading (IntelliJ HTTP client or VS Code REST Client)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": "VW-ID4-001",
  "recordedAt": "{{$isoTimestamp}}",
  "speedKmh": 87.5,
  "batteryPercent": 12.0,
  "batteryTempC": 31.2,
  "odometerKm": 15230.4,
  "latitude": 52.5200,
  "longitude": 13.4050,
  "dtcCodes": ["P0A80"]
}

### Invalid reading -> 400 with a list of errors
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": "car 1",
  "speedKmh": 900
}

### All vehicles
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/vehicles

### Latest status of one vehicle
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/vehicles/VW-ID4-001/status

### Readings of the last hour
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/vehicles/VW-ID4-001/readings?limit=20

### Critical alerts
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/alerts?severity=CRITICAL

### Health and metrics
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/health
